Project Documentation template covers:

Scope Document
Project Plan
Effort Estimation
Software Requirements Specification (SRS)
Software Design Document (SDD)
User Manual
Change Request
Scrum Meeting Notes

Each section explains:

The document’s purpose
Who typically owns it
When it is created
Its expected output
Ready-to-fill tables and fields
Approval, traceability, risk, and acceptance sections where relevant

Replace text inside brackets—such as [Project name] or [Enter information]—with project details.
